{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-reactive-bt","title":"并行与响应式行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/advanced/parallel-reactive-bt","wordCount":530,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行与响应式行为树\">并行与响应式行为树</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基础 BT 按优先级串行决策，但游戏 AI 常需要「同时做多件事」并在高优先级事件发生时立即响应。<strong>并行节点</strong>处理同时执行的需求；<strong>响应式 BT</strong> 通过 Observer 和 Abort 机制处理优先级抢占。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Root Selector] --&gt; B[Sequence\\n战斗优先级]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Sequence\\n默认行为]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Condition\\nEnemyVisible\\nObserver=BOTH]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Parallel\\nRequireAll]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[Action\\nMoveTo攻击位]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B4[Parallel\\nRequireOne]&#10;    B4 --&gt; B5[Service\\n更新目标位置]&#10;    B4 --&gt; B6[Condition\\nLowHealth]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Action\\nPatrol]\">graph TD\n    A[Root Selector] --&gt; B[Sequence\\n战斗优先级]\n    A --&gt; C[Sequence\\n默认行为]\n    B --&gt; B1[Condition\\nEnemyVisible\\nObserver=BOTH]\n    B --&gt; B2[Parallel\\nRequireAll]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[Action\\nMoveTo攻击位]\n    B2 --&gt; B4[Parallel\\nRequireOne]\n    B4 --&gt; B5[Service\\n更新目标位置]\n    B4 --&gt; B6[Condition\\nLowHealth]\n    C --&gt; C1[Action\\nPatrol]</pre><p><strong>Parallel Policy 完整矩阵</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Success Policy</th>\n<th>Failure Policy</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REQUIRE_ONE</td>\n<td>REQUIRE_ONE</td>\n<td>任意完成即结束（SUCCESS 或 FAILURE）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REQUIRE_ONE</td>\n<td>REQUIRE_ALL</td>\n<td>任一成功即 SUCCESS，全部失败才 FAILURE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REQUIRE_ALL</td>\n<td>REQUIRE_ONE</td>\n<td>全部成功才 SUCCESS，任一失败即 FAILURE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REQUIRE_ALL</td>\n<td>REQUIRE_ALL</td>\n<td>全部结束才决定（最宽松）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"parallel-的三种经典用法\">Parallel 的三种经典用法</h2><p><strong>用法一：并发守护条件</strong>——一边执行主行为，一边监视退出条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Parallel [逃跑行为] SuccessPolicy=REQUIRE_ONE, FailurePolicy=REQUIRE_ALL&#10;  ├── Action: FleeToSafeZone           ← 主行为：跑到安全区&#10;  └── Inverter&#10;        └── Condition: IsBeingChased   ← 退出条件：不再被追了就停止逃跑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Parallel [逃跑行为] SuccessPolicy=REQUIRE_ONE, FailurePolicy=REQUIRE_ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Action: FleeToSafeZone           ← 主行为：跑到安全区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Inverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── Condition: IsBeingChased   ← 退出条件：不再被追了就停止逃跑</span></span></code></pre></div><p>含义：同时执行「逃跑」和「检查是否还在被追」，任一成功（到达安全区 OR 不再被追）即停止。</p>\n<p><strong>用法二：行为同步点</strong>——多个异步行为必须同时完成才算成功：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Parallel [团队协调] SuccessPolicy=REQUIRE_ALL, FailurePolicy=REQUIRE_ONE&#10;  ├── Action: MoveToFlankPosition       ← 需要 AI A 就位&#10;  └── Action: WaitForAllySignal         ← 同时等待盟友信号\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Parallel [团队协调] SuccessPolicy=REQUIRE_ALL, FailurePolicy=REQUIRE_ONE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Action: MoveToFlankPosition       ← 需要 AI A 就位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Action: WaitForAllySignal         ← 同时等待盟友信号</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用法三：后台监控 + 主行为</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ParallelWithMonitor extends ParallelNode {&#10;  constructor(mainBehavior: BTNode, monitorCondition: BTNode) {&#10;    super(&#10;      [monitorCondition, mainBehavior],&#10;      ParallelPolicy.REQUIRE_ALL, // 主行为必须完成&#10;      ParallelPolicy.REQUIRE_ONE, // 监控条件失败立即退出&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;const patrolWithAlert = new ParallelWithMonitor(&#10;  new ActionPatrol(),&#10;  new InverterDecorator(new ConditionIsEnemyVisible()), // 看到敌人则退出&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ParallelWithMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ParallelNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mainBehavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">monitorCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [monitorCondition, mainBehavior],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ALL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 主行为必须完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ParallelPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REQUIRE_ONE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 监控条件失败立即退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> patrolWithAlert</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ParallelWithMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActionPatrol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InverterDecorator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConditionIsEnemyVisible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 看到敌人则退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"abort-机制-响应式行为抢占\">Abort 机制：响应式行为抢占</h2><p>Abort 机制是响应式 BT 的核心，它允许高优先级分支在条件满足时中止正在运行的低优先级分支：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"enum AbortType {&#10;  NONE, // 不允许中止&#10;  SELF, // 自身条件变为 FAILURE 时中止自身&#10;  LOWER_PRIORITY, // 自身条件变为 SUCCESS 时中止低优先级兄弟节点&#10;  BOTH, // SELF + LOWER_PRIORITY&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ReactiveSelectorNode extends SelectorNode {&#10;  private conditionObservers: Map&lt;number, Observer&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  onEnter(blackboard: Blackboard, agentId: string): void {&#10;    // 为每个子节点的前置 Condition 注册 Observer&#10;    this.children.forEach((child, index) =&gt; {&#10;      const conditions = this.getConditionKeys(child);&#10;      for (const key of conditions) {&#10;        const observer = blackboard.observe(key, agentId, (newVal) =&gt; {&#10;          this.onConditionChanged(index, newVal as boolean, agentId);&#10;        });&#10;        this.conditionObservers.set(index, observer);&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private onConditionChanged(childIndex: number, satisfied: boolean, agentId: string): void {&#10;    const abortType = this.children[childIndex].getAbortType?.() ?? AbortType.NONE;&#10;&#10;    if ((satisfied &amp;&amp; abortType === AbortType.LOWER_PRIORITY) || abortType === AbortType.BOTH) {&#10;      // 高优先级条件满足，中止当前正在运行的低优先级子节点&#10;      if (this.currentIndex &gt; childIndex) {&#10;        this.children[this.currentIndex].onAbort?.();&#10;        this.currentIndex = childIndex; // 重新从高优先级开始&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onExit(blackboard: Blackboard, agentId: string): void {&#10;    for (const observer of this.conditionObservers.values()) {&#10;      observer.unsubscribe();&#10;    }&#10;    this.conditionObservers.clear();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  NONE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不允许中止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SELF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自身条件变为 FAILURE 时中止自身</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  LOWER_PRIORITY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自身条件变为 SUCCESS 时中止低优先级兄弟节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  BOTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SELF + LOWER_PRIORITY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReactiveSelectorNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SelectorNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> conditionObservers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Observer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onEnter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">agentId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 为每个子节点的前置 Condition 注册 Observer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.children.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4